400.description:
The request is invalid. One of:
- a required property (`category`, `name`, `entityMetadata`,
  `entityMetadata.sourceType`, `operatorId`, `field`) is missing, or
  `category` / `sourceType` is not a supported value;
- `name` is empty or contains characters other than letters,
  digits and `_`, or `description` is longer than 150 characters;
- `entityMetadata` does not carry the property that matches its
  `sourceType`, or carries any other property;
- `operatorId` is not a valid operator ID;
- the operator has no active version or its `outputFormat` is not
  `JSON`;
- `field` has more than two segments, contains unsupported
  characters, or does not resolve to a `number` or `integer`
  property in the operator's output schema.
